  id: salt_widow
  displayName: The Salt Widow
  classification: Drowned revenant
  lore: Walks up out of the harbour on the anniversary of the drowning, looking for
    the house she left. Harmless if you don't answer the door.
  symptoms:
  - wet footprints
  - cold rot smell
  - weeping at low tide
  weaknessText: Return her wedding ring to the water at the hour she went in.
